 "beats": {
  "w4-unlock": [
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "📺 You press on the added danger — gently, but on camera. Wolfgang breaks a little. \"I was ASHAMED,\" they say. \"Of hiding.\" The village hears it. The performance ends. The shame is real and so is the relief."
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "🛟 Wolfgang stands up by the fire. \"We take the hit and we answer it — standing here isn't an answer. Here's what we CAN do — pick one, maybe two, but everything costs something.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Carlos Diaz is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "🕯️ Carlos is dead — and the dead hold no treaties. Every link Haven has shakes."
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "🕯️ Carlos Diaz is dead — combat. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Theo blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers."
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "🌿 Wolfgang checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~11 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 81,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. The spiral has started."
   },
   {
    "day": 82,
    "text": "🌿 Wolfgang checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~9 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the water run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 82,
