    "text": "🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 82,
    "text": "🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 83,
    "text": "📡 The Mirror Draft is still waiting. Stand on the grid with the Final Draft — 2 of 3 kinds faced."
   },
   {
    "day": 83,
    "text": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. Ad Break is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch d"
